{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新した後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情報解禁していいと指示受けたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くに更新して後悔..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日間撮影してたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 1st写真集だったのでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁああああああああああ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容はひみつだけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が過ごした夏。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く見てほしいなあー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなこと詰め込んだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素のみんなが見れるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ15歳なんだね。というか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結成当時の私の年齢だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか変な感じするな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔ちっちゃいいいいなんだこいつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はライブリハやって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木のの収録した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アットホームな感じで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーい楽しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録中に窓から花火が見えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか切なかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日浴衣着てる人いっぱい見た。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなおめかししてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏はあついね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな意味で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/10/4061146/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は横浜個握だよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちだってあついよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣じゃないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいおしゃべりしましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何話したい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break